      "extensions": {
        ".zip": "NAOMI",
        ".dat": "NAOMI",
        ".lst": "NAOMI"
      },
      "_extensions_note": "A MAME set is a .zip and lands here whichever board it is for; the core reads the table and sends a NAOMI 2 or Atomiswave set to a project made for that machine (or, opened without a project, says which it wanted). .dat and .lst are the decrypted dumps of the nullDC era, which this core also loads; a decrypted .bin is not claimed, because .bin is a Mega Drive cartridge to every other package, and goes in through the wizard instead."
    },
