    {
      "id": "naomi.zip",
      "display": "NAOMI Bios Set",
      "description": "The NAOMI BIOS set, in the file MAME calls naomi.zip, with the revisions epr-21576, 21577 and 21578 inside. It is a MAME set. The whole zip is given to the core, which uses the ROM in it that matches the Region setting. No size or hash is required, because MAME sets differ between versions and dumps. The core checks the ROMs it takes from the set by their own checksums.",
      "name": "naomi.zip",
      "requiredWhen": {
